{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0253_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "c753eda051a169fd0f145bc5335e7a97132b2d89ad8510706b0e33402174de46", "ja": "可愛い衣装に、明るい笑顔！　そして、\n楽しいトークでの、お客さんとの交流……！", "zh": "可爱的服装，灿烂的笑容！而且，\n还能通过开心的交谈，和客人们交流……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0253_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "3f6e13a2d0f824f143928609a5ca0733dd55f81689ad984c436dcea45bfc0ad5", "ja": "そう！　……ウェイトレスには\nアイドルちゃんの全てが凝縮されてるんです！", "zh": "没错！……女服务生身上，凝聚了偶像的一切！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0253_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "e6eca77c6b1c44a4d5860e2a5d7a6599562d32e3f5f9b7c995164371ee62d2fc", "ja": "そんな、憧れのウェイトレスになれるなんて……。\nふおぉぉぉーっ、ありさ、感激ですっ！", "zh": "没想到竟然能成为憧憬已久的女服务生……。\n呜哦哦哦——亚利莎太感动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0253_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1965ea8f93c3fd36718d2e6aaeee136300ecd530d7f9697b34f28e4fec7b3c2c", "ja": "おお、そこまで感動してくれるとは。\nその衣装を選んだ甲斐があったな。", "zh": "哦，没想到你会感动到这种程度。  \n看来选这套服装真是选对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0253_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "45b534e321ffbe5f4be2319a13f8716a97b1ca5b74fc2e0ffb86e34ed56782da", "ja": "はい、さすが{$P$}さんですよぉ！\nこの衣装は着てヨシ、眺めてヨシ、撮ってヨシ……。", "zh": "是的，不愧是{$P$}先生！\n这套服装穿着好看、观赏也好看、拍照更好看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0253_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "73832f7f6971503ec3a989c3d7079b3d3759b8b94839eab584a6bd136c1f82da", "ja": "つまり！　このプリティウェイトレスは、\n最強の衣装なんです！　わかりますか！？", "zh": "也就是说！这套可爱的女服务生装，\n就是最强的服装！明白了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0253_1010", "source_sha256": "46512de4d908a50401bbd337fcc9231bfbe2fbd979f6d99887b6725c4e9e3090", "ja": "わかるわかる！", "zh": "很懂很懂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
