{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0253_2006_028ari", "source_sha256": "c0a41cf08cf2424e17873822d8bd43207f1efd3dd496214b62984647b9b7229c", "ja": "はいっ！　{$P$}さんのご注文、\n承りました！　ありさにお任せくださいっ♪", "zh": "好的！已接下{$P$}先生的订单！\n就交给亚利沙吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
